Expanding Industrial Applications: Potash is also used in applications such as glass, soap, detergents, and chemical manufacturing, broadening demand beyond agriculture.
Emerging-Market Opportunities: Growing agricultural sectors in Asia-Pacific and Latin America are creating additional demand, while investments in mining and processing technologies are supporting supply capabilities.

